  "status": "Refused",
  "actual_commencement_date": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed extension, by virtue of its inappropriate size and scale, would result in a loss of light, outlook and increased sense of enclosure, harming the living conditions of 80 Rosebery Road contrary to Local Plan Policies CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations); the Part A5 of the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD, and the principles of the National Planning Policy Framework. ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed development, by virtue of its size, scale, position and design, would fail to be proportionate and subservient to the host building. Instead, it would create a bulky and incongruous addition that would negatively impact the character and appearance of the host property and the surrounding area. The proposal is therefore contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations); the Part A5 of the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD, and the principles of the National Planning Policy Framework. "
  ],
